# Grid B — U11 Locate by role (role → identifier)
#
# Gap target: role descriptions ("the entry function that does X")
# have no subject kind. The pipeline has SubjectFunctionName but
# no role-indexed search; the explorer has to guess keywords from
# the role description.
#
# Ground truth: buildAnalysisIR in internal/agent/analyzer.go is the
# canonical single entry point that turns a user request into an
# AnalysisIR via the 6-step deterministic chain. Correct answer is
# exactly that function; wrong answers include "analyze" (too
# generic), "Planner" (deleted role), or "Execute" (BaseAgent
# method — wrong abstraction level).
#
# Negative anchors catch the specific drift toward deleted write-
# pipeline roles.
ID="u11a"
NAME="locate by role — entry for parsing request into structured IR"
QUESTION="仓库里负责「解析用户请求并产出结构化 AnalysisIR」的那个入口函数具体叫什么名字？在哪个文件？"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="buildAnalysisIR"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="Planner CodeReviewer DesignReviewer"
